       611-UPDATE-FILE.
           CALL "TALWONO"      USING WO-BUFFER RETURN-COD.
           MOVE WO-BUFFER      TO WONUM OF WO-PLANNED.
           START WO-PLANNED    KEY = WONUM OF WO-PLANNED
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/002:
      **  WORKORDER NOT FOUND
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  49        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   2        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               PERFORM 611-ERROR
               GO TO 611-UF-EXIT.

           READ WO-PLANNED     NEXT INTO WO-PLANNED-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/002:
      **  WORKORDER NOT FOUND
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  49        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   2        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               PERFORM 611-ERROR
               GO TO 611-UF-EXIT.

           IF WO-BUFFER NOT = WO-NUM-PLANNED
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/002:
      **  WORKORDER NOT FOUND
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  49        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE   2        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               PERFORM 611-ERROR
               GO TO 611-UF-EXIT.

           IF WO-STATUS-P = WO-STAT-2
               GO TO 611-UF-EXIT.

           IF WO-STATUS-P NOT = WO-STAT-1
               MOVE WO-STAT-1  TO CAT-TEXT2
      **********************************************************************
      **    MESSAGE 049/021:
      **  W/O STATUS NOT CURRENTLY
      **********************************************************************
               MOVE  49        TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE  21        TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER  TO CAT-TEXT1
               MOVE CAT-TEXT-BUFFER TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               PERFORM 611-ERROR
               GO TO 611-UF-EXIT.

           MOVE WO-STAT-2      TO WO-STATUS-P.
           REWRITE PWO-REC     FROM WO-PLANNED-DATA
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE "REWRITE " TO DB-FUNC
               MOVE "WO-PLANNED" TO DB-FILE
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE DB-ERROR   TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               PERFORM 611-ERROR
               GO TO 611-UF-EXIT.

           MOVE SPACES         TO T-WO-DATA T-STATUS-DATA.
           MOVE WO-NUM-PLANNED TO WO-NUM-TRACK.
           MOVE CURDATE-BUFFER TO DATE-STAMP.
           IF DATE-STAMP-YY > 70
               MOVE 19 TO DATE-STAMP-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE 20 TO DATE-STAMP-CC.
           ACCEPT TIME-BUFFER  FROM TIME.
           MOVE TIME-HM        TO TIME-STAMP.
           MOVE WO-START-STATUS TO WO-TYPE-STATUS.
           MOVE "PLAN"         TO USER-ID CLOCK-CARD.
           MOVE WO-STATUS-P    TO WO-STATUS-TRACK TRANS-STATUS.
           CALL "TWOTRACK" USING WO-TRACK-DATA.

       611-UF-EXIT.            EXIT.

       610-ERROR.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERRMSGB.
           MOVE TRUE-VAL       TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER) IND(99).

       611-ERROR.
           MOVE 1              TO ERROR-SW.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERRMSG.
           MOVE TRUE-VAL       TO IND(FIELD-NUMBER) IND(99).

       999-CATREAD.
           MOVE SPACES         TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           CALL "CCATREAD"     USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       999-CATREAD-EXIT.       EXIT.

